      "text": "Astra: In your latest attempt, an earlier line labeled \u201coriginal\u201d contains \u201c\u4e3a \u00ab*\u00bb,\u201d while the carried \u201coriginal\u201d contains \u201c\u4e3a\u4e86 \u00ab\u00bb\u201d; could the tentative finding be that your record changed, with correctness still undecided and a source comparison only a proposed, unperformed next action?\n\nWhat is this carried passage meant to preserve, and which detail deserves closer attention?\n\nWould staying with that question clarify what must remain unchanged, or would a small attempt provide better evidence about what you actually preserved?\n\nWhich thinking or doing step will you choose and carry out now?\n\nWhat observation would make you change that choice?\n\nWhen you continue, what finding and its visible source, remaining uncertainty, and unfinished next step will you bring forward?"
